  <rules>
    <rule name="Resourceful" id="ab2c-1fbc-90f8-488c" hidden="false">
      <description>In the Ready step of each Strategy phase after the first, you gain Resourceful points determined by the number of friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operatives in the killzone that aren’t within control range of enemy operatives. At the end of each turning point, discard your Resourceful points. 


5+ Operatives - 2 Resourceful Points
1-4 Operatives - 1 Resourceful Points


You can spend 1 of your Resourceful points during each activation of each friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operative to do one of the following:
- Before or after it performs an action, if it’s not within control range of enemy operatives, you can use this rule. If you do, add 1 to that friendly operative’s APL stat until the end of its activation.
- When it’s activated, if it’s not within control range of enemy operatives, it regains up to D3+1 lost wounds.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Dauntless Explorers" id="c85c-60fc-8ea9-d296" hidden="false">
      <description>STRATEGIC GAMBIT in the first turning point. Each friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operative wholly within your drop zone can immediately perform a free Reposition action. Each that does so must end that move wholly within 4&quot; of your drop zone.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
